<newsitem itemid="184755" id="root" date="1996-11-12" xml:lang="en">
<title>GERMANY: Adidas profits rise in third quarter.</title>
<headline>Adidas profits rise in third quarter.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third calendar quarter</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   140     vs   120</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			     187     vs   143</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   169     vs   136</p>
<p>NOTE - Adidas is a manufacturer of sports goods.  </p>
<p>    Turnover				   1,470     vs 1,090</p>
<p>Nine months to end September:</p>
<p>    Net profit				   324     vs   251</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				436     vs   303</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   376     vs   275</p>
<p>    Turnover				   3,710     vs 2,840</p>
</text>
